WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.940
Posit is the only native, enterprise-grade R & Python data science platform inside Snowflake.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:17.139
And being inside is key.

00:00:17.139 --> 00:00:21.740
A lot of data science teams are still working outside their data platform, pulling extracts

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:27.799
to laptops, copying data into separate environments, fighting with credentials.

00:00:27.799 --> 00:00:33.419
With Posit Team, the complete data science lifecycle takes place within Snowflake.

00:00:33.419 --> 00:00:39.180
Your data never leaves, IT governance flows from Snowflake itself, and your team gets

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:42.639
the open-source tools they already know and love.

00:00:42.639 --> 00:00:46.799
You can find the Posit Team native app in the Snowflake Marketplace.

00:00:46.799 --> 00:00:53.639
Here, Posit Workbench, Connect, and Package Manager run inside Snowpark container services.

00:00:53.639 --> 00:00:57.160
Simply launch your favorite IDEs from Workbench.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:01.959
Security roles, network policies, audit logs are all managed through Snowflake.

00:01:01.959 --> 00:01:04.160
Prefer to bring your own infrastructure?

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:09.320
The Connected app lets your team work from wherever Workbench or Connect already run,

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:12.919
and hooks into Snowflake securely with managed credentials.

00:01:12.919 --> 00:01:19.059
Either way, your data scientists query Snowflake tables with dplyr or pandas, tap into Cortex

00:01:19.059 --> 00:01:24.599
for secure AI assistance, and use Orbital to translate models into native SQL.

00:01:24.599 --> 00:01:29.480
Predictions run inside Snowflake, no separate scoring infrastructure.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:35.839
When work is ready to share, publish to Posit Connect, dashboards, reports, APIs, Shiny,

00:01:35.839 --> 00:01:37.879
and Streamlit apps.

00:01:37.879 --> 00:01:42.360
Your data scientists work in their favorite tools, your IT and compliance teams get the

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:47.919
governance they need, and your AI investments – Cortex, your warehouses, your shared models

00:01:47.919 --> 00:01:51.959
– show up directly in your team's day-to-day workflow.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.120
Analyze with semantic awareness.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:59.559
Posit's Snowflake skill for Posit Assistant and Query Chat agentically discovers your

00:01:59.559 --> 00:02:06.360
schemas, tables, views, and any semantic models, building a complete picture of your data.

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:11.559
It gives the agent the right context to analyze complex questions that are specific to your

00:02:11.559 --> 00:02:16.800
organization – all inside the platform you trust.

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:19.839
Posit Team is available now in the Snowflake Marketplace.

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:25.279
Install it in minutes with a free 30-day trial, or visit posit.co slash snowflake to

00:02:25.279 --> 00:02:29.960
talk to us.

